    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This top down 2.5D ghost story mystery will take the player through a Louisiana inspired neighborhood haunting.\u00a0The short story format allows for both easy accessibility and let's you discover up to 5 endings without the burden of a 30+ hour RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/8247f88ea5f8d4ffae00709035bb0e0c.avif?t=1754145672\" data-has-big width=800 height=558 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using Spirit Vision, Clair leaves their body in an astral form to explore the history of the place and dig deeper into the truth of the festering catalyst of its haunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/fbab445da807e4ca4aaaaac7431d51b2.poster.avif?t=1754145672\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/fbab445da807e4ca4aaaaac7431d51b2.webm?t=1754145672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/fbab445da807e4ca4aaaaac7431d51b2.mp4?t=1754145672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The recently developed neighborhood of Myrtle Grove is filled with an awkward anxiety. The source is the ghost, but is there more affecting the safety or social dynamics of the community?\u00a0Explore the subdivision as Clair and talk to the curious batch of residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/cb69c0b4d0159f4e13ee311ba1ff21b3.avif?t=1754145672\" data-has-big width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind every lingering spirit is an unresolved tragedy. Do you have the courage to find it?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This top down 2.5D ghost story mystery will take the player through a Louisiana inspired neighborhood haunting.\u00a0The short story format allows for both easy accessibility and let's you discover up to 5 endings without the burden of a 30+ hour RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/8247f88ea5f8d4ffae00709035bb0e0c.avif?t=1754145672\" data-has-big width=800 height=558 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using Spirit Vision, Clair leaves their body in an astral form to explore the history of the place and dig deeper into the truth of the festering catalyst of its haunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/fbab445da807e4ca4aaaaac7431d51b2.poster.avif?t=1754145672\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/fbab445da807e4ca4aaaaac7431d51b2.webm?t=1754145672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/fbab445da807e4ca4aaaaac7431d51b2.mp4?t=1754145672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The recently developed neighborhood of Myrtle Grove is filled with an awkward anxiety. The source is the ghost, but is there more affecting the safety or social dynamics of the community?\u00a0Explore the subdivision as Clair and talk to the curious batch of residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141000/extras/cb69c0b4d0159f4e13ee311ba1ff21b3.avif?t=1754145672\" data-has-big width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind every lingering spirit is an unresolved tragedy. Do you have the courage to find it?</p>",
